WEBVTT

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:27.080
I don't mind saving them,

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:29.250
Luna and Seira,

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:32.260
if you'll come with me.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.570
What is it that you're after?

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:40.010
Well, to put it simply,

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:44.770
I want to mate with you.

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:57.020
<b>Choosing Your Destiny</b>

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:09.470
<i>Wouldn't it be better 
for you to kill her?</i>

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:21.760
<i>Why did this happen?</i>

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.430
<i>We're friends.</i>

00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:25.870
<i>So why?</i>

00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:32.150
I see. Cerebrum and Akari-kun...

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:35.430
That's why he took the Clessidra.

00:01:35.830 --> 00:01:40.030
What exactly <i>is</i> the Clessidra?

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:43.510
Well, who knows?

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:52.040
If you come with me, I'll 
return Luna to normal.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:55.920
And as a result, the 
elemental powers that Luna

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:58.430
stole from Seira can be 
returned to her as well.

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:04.260
You'll really save them?

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:07.270
Yes. I swear.

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:11.270
Please save them!

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:14.320
That's more like it.

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:27.420
This is...

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.270
The Sephirothic Tree.

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:39.170
Look.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:40.810
Isn't it pretty?

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:45.180
This is a cradle, our cradle.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:47.680
Cradle?

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:52.440
Inside here, you'll 
have to face yourself.

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:53.440
Huh?

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:56.440
What you really are.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:59.950
Where you came from, and 
where you're trying to go.

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:04.330
Once all of that is done, 
we'll become one.

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:28.890
Stay away, Luna...

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:34.680
In the physical world, Daemonia 
and humans cannot intermix.

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:38.610
The Clessidra is the stage where

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:41.180
the two life forms can 
mate with each other.

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:45.110
Since he lured Akari-kun 
into the Clessidra,

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:47.660
this is probably his intention.

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:51.410
Come.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:21.890
Luna!

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:28.450
Was it all right to let her go?

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:35.900
I do not know. But if that's 
what Akari-san chose...

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:43.540
Hello?

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:47.470
Seira-san and Luna-san have?

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:49.720
They suddenly came back.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:52.300
According to Seira-oneetan,

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:55.350
they were suddenly pulled 
into the Astralux.

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:59.710
She thinks it was Akari-oneetan 
that brought them back.

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:07.510
Akari!

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:09.360
Akari!

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.420
Akari!

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:13.870
Akari!

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:17.070
Akari! Akari!

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:22.590
Come on. Hurry and get up.

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:24.340
You'll be late.

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:27.460
Huh? Auntie? Why?

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:29.350
What are you mumbling about?

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:31.970
You're the one that'll 
be sorry if you're late.

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:34.470
It's the 2nd anniversary 
of Hinata's death.

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:41.810
Fuyuna!

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:43.230
What?

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.730
Come on, hurry up. We're leaving.

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:47.240
Oh, right.

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:51.240
<i>This is...</i>

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:54.860
<i>That day...</i>

00:05:56.630 --> 00:05:59.410
<i>This is what it means to face myself?</i>

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:12.930
<i>That day is being repeated.</i>

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:14.930
<i>That day is</i>

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:16.310
<i>happening once again.</i>

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:43.670
Now the two of them 
should fully recover.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:49.040
I'm sorry, Luna-san. 
You just came back...

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:50.830
I'm sorry.

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:54.480
I've done something terrible.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.670
I'm really...

00:06:58.270 --> 00:06:59.740
Don't worry about it.

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:03.100
More importantly, we have 
to find where Akari is.

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:05.970
She's not in the Astralux?

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:08.610
Itsuki-san and the others 
are looking for her,

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:11.880
but they can't sense her energy anywhere.

00:07:11.880 --> 00:07:13.990
Akari-san, where did you go?

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:16.130
The Clessidra, meow.

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:20.570
Clessidra?

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:24.440
It's not the real world 
or the Astralux.

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:26.870
It's a world that's 
unknown to us, meow.

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:28.260
What does that mean?

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:33.010
It's said that the Astralux is a 
world with multiple levels, meow.

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:38.520
Feelings and desires, the subconscious, 
is within the Astralux,

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:42.830
but apparently this is a level with 
an even higher dimension, meow.

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:45.520
How do we get there?

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:47.950
That's a hard question, meow.

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:06.130
<i>Soon Fuyuna will be here.</i>

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:13.690
<i>Why did Fuyuna become a Daemonia?</i>

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:21.390
<i>I can't wait here like this. 
I have to ask her.</i>

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:22.890
<i>Right now should be—</i>

00:08:27.990 --> 00:08:29.120
Where are you going?

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:39.130
Tell me! Why did you become a Daemonia?

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:44.620
What did I do?

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:51.130
What don't you like about me?

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:52.460
Why?

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:55.560
Why, Fuyuna?!

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:59.190
When you try to force yourself into 
other people's hearts like that...

00:08:59.670 --> 00:09:00.890
I hate that!

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:03.670
You always want to know everything.

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:05.500
Even things people don't 
want you to know.

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:06.930
You force yourself in.

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:08.150
You're a meddler.

00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:12.040
That's why I ended 
up becoming a Daemonia!

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:23.240
No! This isn't right! Why?!

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.800
No!

00:09:43.990 --> 00:09:45.680
How do you feel?

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:48.690
That was another reality.

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:51.070
One you didn't pick.

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:52.690
Reality?

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:55.620
The person who is in here has

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:58.620
their subconscious come to realization

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:01.040
and time repeats itself 
over and over.

00:10:01.570 --> 00:10:04.830
For you, it was apparently that night.

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:10.210
If you accept me, I 
can end that for you.

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.350
What will you do?

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:13.590
There's no way I can do that!

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:16.120
Thought so.

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:19.970
Then you'll just have 
to keep repeating it.

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:21.940
Every time that night comes,

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:26.960
the pain will cause the 
layers of your heart to be

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:28.980
peeled away one by one

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:33.980
until your heart has nothing 
protecting it and becomes exposed.

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:36.380
I'll be looking forward to it.

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:39.820
When you decide to accept everything...

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:54.090
Because of my weakness...

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:56.710
Luna.

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:00.890
Seira-san, um...

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:02.040
Come with me.

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:04.600
We're going to go look for Akari.

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:10.820
I think that Akari probably made 
a deal with Cerebrum to save us.

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:14.680
Akari was the one Cerebrum was after.

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:19.280
So he attacked Ginka, you,

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:20.940
and then me so he could get her alone.

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:22.240
For what?

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:25.490
I don't know. But we 
need to look for her.

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:27.990
We'll keep looking for 
her and save her.

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:29.110
No matter what.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:38.420
We were inquiring within the Astralux, 
and found a weird place.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:39.570
What's this?

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:42.010
It's a place we've never seen before.

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:43.460
Before.

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:45.010
This is...

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:48.770
Cerebrum took me there.

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:50.680
Really?

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:52.900
We'll get the coordinates right now.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:54.020
Let's go.

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:02.610
Um, Seira-san...

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:03.280
What?

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:07.820
I'm sorry. I have to apologize 
to you, Seira-san.

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:10.040
I already heard.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:14.090
I heard how you felt about me and that

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:15.790
that was how he got to you.

00:12:16.890 --> 00:12:19.240
That weakness is fatal.

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:22.110
My past self would have 
said that and cut you off.

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:25.740
But then Akari made me realize...

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:27.720
The four of us...

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:30.030
You're my friend, Luna.

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:32.810
Seira-san...

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:36.940
I'll accept you. 
That weakness... everything.

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:50.770
Um, Fuyuna...

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:51.960
What?

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:53.460
Um...

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:57.210
<i>When you try to force yourself into 
other people's hearts like that...</i>

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:58.210
<i>I hate that!</i>

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:01.940
I'm sorry. It's nothing.

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:11.720
Please! Let me hear

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:13.750
your voice.

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:48.180
Akari-san!

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:49.680
Akari!

00:13:54.970 --> 00:13:56.190
Akari-san!

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:10.700
<i>Fuyuna...</i>

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:16.960
<i>I couldn't change it again.</i>

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:53.240
Luna, are you okay?

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:56.500
I'll fight, too!

00:14:58.150 --> 00:15:00.520
I don't want to run anymore!

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:01.250
Luna!

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:10.740
<i>You're my friend, Luna.</i>

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:13.820
<i>I won't disappear while you're gone.</i>

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:17.850
<i>Just how weak am I?</i>

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:20.640
<i>I was scared of fighting.</i>

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:24.320
<i>I was scared to be alone, 
and just like a child,</i>

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:27.480
<i>I felt like Seira-san was going 
to take Akari-san from me.</i>

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:31.400
<i>Even then, she didn't abandon me.</i>

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:33.910
<i>She called me a friend.</i>

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:38.960
<i>I was always looking behind me, 
but from now on...</i>

00:15:49.490 --> 00:15:50.580
Luna?

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:51.490
I'm fine.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:57.390
<i>There's got to be a 
way to defeat them.</i>

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:06.940
I did it! Seira-san!

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:09.690
There! Aim for that red eye!

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:10.440
Got it!

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:18.690
<i>Hey, Fuyuna...</i>

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:23.410
<i>Why did we end up like this?</i>

00:16:24.730 --> 00:16:27.260
<i>We lived together for so long.</i>

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:29.880
<i>So why?</i>

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:31.730
<i>Why?</i>

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:34.050
<i>Why?</i>

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:48.280
I like that look you're 
getting on your face.

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:51.980
I think you've got it wrong, actually.

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:57.540
You seem to think that 
Fuyuna doesn't like you,

00:16:57.540 --> 00:16:58.410
but it's the opposite, isn't it?

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:00.840
It's you.

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:03.410
You're the one who hated Fuyuna.

00:17:04.820 --> 00:17:07.730
Fuyuna caught on to your malicious 
feelings, took them in,

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:09.670
and she saw you as an enemy.

00:17:10.310 --> 00:17:12.400
That's why she became a Daemonia.

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:17.590
It's all because of the evil 
and dark feelings within you.

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:20.430
That... That's...

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:23.060
Take a good look at reality.

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:30.780
If Fuyuna hadn't met you, she 
wouldn't have ended up like that.

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:39.320
The next time might be the last.

00:17:47.890 --> 00:17:50.590
Did you have a change of 
heart and come back, meow?

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:52.850
I only came here because 
I was ordered to.

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:58.160
Why don't you handle that 
more carefully, meow?

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:00.440
You ask too much.

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:05.700
Selfish as ever, meow.

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:11.610
The Leguzario are showing 
some mercy, meow.

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:13.790
You know what this is, meow?

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:14.880
Yes.

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:18.240
It means that they'll allow your 
release for a moment, meow.

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:19.490
At this point?

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:22.620
The Leguzario would also 
like for Cerebrum

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:25.450
and Akari to avoid going to 
the next level, meow.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:28.240
Various powers will 
become warped, meow.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:32.250
We had stated that we 
had taken up arms.

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:35.760
To them, that's rather 
insignificant, meow.

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:40.400
I'm sure it doesn't make you happy,

00:18:40.400 --> 00:18:42.180
but you should use it 
to your advantage, meow.

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:47.910
So in the end, they 
only see us as tools.

00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:53.700
This is only for the sake 
of saving Akari-san.

00:19:21.770 --> 00:19:22.750
Luna!

00:19:24.060 --> 00:19:26.140
Luna, you've gotten stronger.

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:29.140
That might be thanks to you, Seira-san.

00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:32.270
Let's hurry and save Akari.

00:19:32.590 --> 00:19:33.530
Yes!

00:19:35.710 --> 00:19:36.600
Luna!

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:08.290
Takoyaki!

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:19.820
Come on, this way!

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:26.080
Here we go!

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:37.710
I'll make it so you'll never be 
able to get up again, so thank me!

00:20:41.190 --> 00:20:43.260
One, two...

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:04.610
What the heck, you two?

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:07.540
You look like you've just seen a ghost.

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:12.120
Ginka!

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:12.330
Ginka-san!

00:21:12.940 --> 00:21:15.050
Thank goodness, Ginka-san!

00:21:14.110 --> 00:21:15.050
Thank goodness!

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:16.020
Really...

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:20.640
These guys are guards of Clessidra.

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:24.760
Unlike Daemonia, they're moving 
with the Minor Arcana cards.

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:27.530
How do you know that, Ginka-san?

00:21:27.530 --> 00:21:30.890
Once you go to the other side, 
you know everything.

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:34.770
Seira, your body fat percentage 
went up 0.1%, didn't it?

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:37.140
Was she right?

00:21:37.140 --> 00:21:40.120
See? I'm totally awesome.

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:42.400
B-But how?

00:21:43.080 --> 00:21:47.280
We can talk later. More importantly, 
let's go save Akari!

00:21:56.140 --> 00:22:01.390
<i>If she hadn't met you, Fuyuna 
wouldn't have become a Daemonia.</i>

00:22:04.130 --> 00:22:05.440
<i>Soon...</i>

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:08.300
<i>Soon you'll</i>

00:22:08.730 --> 00:22:09.860
<i>become a mother.</i>

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:30.430
<b>The World is the last card of the 
22 Major Arcana cards and is 
considered to be the best card, 
symbolizing completion, endings,
 and success.</b>

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:42.790
<b>#21   The World</b>

00:23:27.230 --> 00:23:27.930
I'm Akari!

00:23:27.930 --> 00:23:28.420
I'm Luna.

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:28.920
Seira.

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:29.880
It's Ginka!

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:32.640
The four of us make up
the Tarot Quartet!

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:31.550
<b>However, endings also 
mean new beginnings.</b>

00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:33.470
<b>One story ends with The World, and returns 
to The Fool for a brand new journey.</b>

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:34.170
When'd we get that name?

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>The World means both the end 
and at the same time, the beginning, 
therefore the return to the origin.</b>

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:35.530
I just came up with it.

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:37.680
<b>If you were to choose this card, all of 
your past efforts will bear fruit and what 
you've been working on will succeed 
and come to an end.</b>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:36.500
Nothing less from you, Akari-san!

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:39.100
Tarot and Quartet both end in "T."

00:23:37.680 --> 00:23:39.890
<b>However if this card is reversed, 
it shows that what you were working
on will come to a halt and stall, 
despite all the effort put into it,
leaving things incomplete.</b>

00:23:37.890 --> 00:23:41.630
<b>The Sun's Smile</b>

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:41.530
See you next time!

00:23:39.890 --> 00:23:41.550
